Global correctness: open-break-even (run 1).
An open holding whose market value equals its remaining basis has no
unrealized gain row.

========== CLI ==========

ledlight unrealized-gains --to 2024-03-31 --format json <<'LEDGER'
commodity USD
  format 1,000.00 USD
  default
commodity FUND
  format 1,000.000 FUND
account Assets:Bank
account Assets:Broker

P 2024-03-01 FUND 100 USD

2024-01-01 Purchase
  Assets:Broker  10 FUND {100 USD}
  Assets:Bank  -1000 USD
LEDGER

========== OUTPUT ==========

[]
